<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: AVONMORE, WATERFORD MERGER APPROVED.</title>
<headline>AVONMORE, WATERFORD MERGER APPROVED.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's Minister for Enterprise, Trade and Employment Mary Harney on Friday approved the proposed merger between Avonmore Foods and Waterford Foods.</p>
<p>Harney's approval paved the way for the creation of the world's fourth largest milk processor and the largest dairy company in Britain and Ireland.</p>
<p>The combined entity will generate turnover of 2.5 billion Irish pounds, giving pre-tax profits of 71.5 million.</p>
</text>
